stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AdminLogin
    AdminLogin --> AdminDashboard
    AdminDashboard --> SelectEvent : Click "Calculate Ranks"
    SelectEvent --> FetchPosters : Retrieve EVALUATED posters
    FetchPosters --> FetchEvaluations : Retrieve associated evaluations
    FetchEvaluations --> CalculateAverage : (Sum of total_scores) / (Count)
    CalculateAverage --> SortDescending : Order by Average Score
    SortDescending --> AssignRanks : Resolve ties (assign same rank)
    AssignRanks --> UpdateEvent : Set results_published = True
    UpdateEvent --> RenderLeaderboard : Display UI
    RenderLeaderboard --> [*]
